      "description": "Lists an n8n seller workflow with the layer (claim its card, the card serves the nonce, verify: the layer reads the card and runs one class probe), then polls for jobs where the seller address is the provider and hands a finished job to the relayer (idempotent on job ID + nonce) and reads its status."
